WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.300
COMPR helps you save clothes while you shop.

00:05.300 --> 00:12.000
Open the extension on a product page to see the detected price, sizes, and available product details.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.600
Save the item to your shortlist, then continue shopping.

00:16.600 --> 00:22.400
COMPR brings your saved products together in one clear comparison.

00:22.400 --> 00:30.200
Search, filter, and compare prices and available details without jumping between tabs.

00:30.200 --> 00:35.300
When you are ready to choose, return to the original product page.

00:35.300 --> 00:40.200
COMPR is free to use, requires no account, and saves your products locally in your browser.
